	"data": "Carnegie Mellon University — Master of Human-Computer Interaction (MHCI)\n\nPart of [[projects/grad-school-options|Grad School Options]] research.\n\nOverview\n\nCarnegie Mellon's MHCI program is one of the oldest and most prestigious HCI professional master's programs in the world, housed in the Human-Computer Interaction Institute (HCII) within the School of Computer Science. It's an intensive 12-month program running Fall→Spring→Summer, designed for people who want to become UX researchers,…",
